1
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:03,640
(Sheldon:)I went to the FBI
and retracted my statement.

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,480
(Howard:)And they were okay with that?

3
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:08,410
(Sheldon:)No. If anything,
I made it worse.

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,320
(Sheldon:)In any case, I have
been riddled with guilt,

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,920
(Sheldon:)which is causing
Gorn-infested REM sleep.

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:18,660
(Sheldon:)So, I'm here now
to say I'm sorry.

7
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,160
(Howard:)Are you kidding me?

8
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
(Howard:)You've set my career back
at least two years,

9
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:25,260
(Howard:)and you think you can make it
right with "I'm sorry"?

10
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:26,730
(Leonard:)Yes.

11
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,200
(Sheldon:)I followed the social protocol.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,140
(Sheldon:)I attempted to right the wrong,
and when I failed to do so,

13
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,740
(Sheldon:)I delivered a heartfelt apology.

14
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:34,940
(Sheldon:)Now you say,

15
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,240
"Apology accepted,"

16
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:39,880
(Sheldon:)and I will offer you
a one-time-only high five.

17
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,220
(Howard:)Your apology is not accepted.

18
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,330
(Sheldon:)You're tricking me.

19
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:45,550
(Sheldon:)It really is, isn't it?

20
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,890
(Howard:)Leave me alone, Sheldon.

21
00:00:50,190 --> 00:00:52,660
(Dr Tyson:)Dr. Cooper, I just
wanted you to know

22
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:55,560
(Dr Tyson:)I'm sorry for the role I
played in the Pluto matter.

23
00:00:55,560 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)Oh, shut up.

